The channel purification module in cpm_module.py is adapted for object
detection from the module described in:

  Xu J, Wang L. ADNet: A Real-Time Floating Algae Segmentation Using
  Distillation Network. Journal of Marine Science and Engineering.
  2024;12(6):852. doi:10.3390/jmse12060852

Two differences from the module as originally described are noted in the
README: the gating function of the variant used by the proposed model is a
sigmoid rather than a channel-wise softmax, and both variants here hold two
learnable scalar parameters, so the branches are combined by a learnable
weighted sum rather than a plain addition.
